{
  "name": "ondra-emotion-core",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的情绪内核：PAD 三维 + 10 个固定标签（单条 0.12 / 标签上限 0.6 / 标签半衰期 45min / 心情 6h）、六维指数回归、化学池三激素（dopamine 50/45min、cortisol 20/30min、serotonin 50/120min + 慢变量规则）、气质四旋钮、动态激素 ≤12 种；存档缺字段按基线 50 补齐不补 0。只产状态，不管表达（那是 O-031），不管应激倍率（那是 O-029）。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
